<title>UK: Ka Wah Bank sets 135 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Ka Wah Bank sets 135 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KA WAH BANK LTD (HK)</p>
<p> AMT    135 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    13.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +50 BP    PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.90     FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.90</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  HONG KONG TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
